%% mdai-fidelity-validator architecture and metric derivation

flowchart LR
    Receiver["Receiver-side mirror<br/>Datadog intake"] --> R8126[":8126 receiver capture"]
    Exporter["Exporter-side mirror<br/>Datadog API payload"] --> E18081[":18081 exporter capture"]
    Synthetic["Synthetic client"] --> Admin[":8080 /observe/..."]

    R8126 --> Capture["Capture + classify<br/>request count"]
    E18081 --> Capture
    Admin --> Capture
    Capture --> Decode["Decompress + decode<br/>JSON / MessagePack / protobuf"]
    Decode --> Split["Split natural groups<br/>trace / series / log correlation"]
    Split --> Flatten["Flatten wire fields"]
    Flatten --> Mapping["Canonical field mapping<br/>YAML + transforms"]
    Mapping --> Correlate["Resolve correlation key<br/>signal:value"]
    Correlate --> Pending{"Opposite side<br/>already pending?"}
    Pending -- no --> Store["In-memory pending map<br/>retention + GC"]
    Pending -- yes --> Compare["Compare pair"]
    Store -. later counterpart .-> Pending

    Policy["Fidelity policy YAML"] --> Required["Required-policy evaluation"]
    Compare --> Full["Canonical full-payload diff<br/>+ trace span diff"]
    Compare --> Required
    Full --> Result["ComparisonResult<br/>admin API + structured log"]
    Required --> Result
    Full --> Metrics[":8888 Prometheus metrics"]
    Required --> Metrics
